  "description": "An idol group of cute little animals and... a jaguar?\n\nIn a world where animals can live as humans, there exists Marigold, a popular idol group comprised of small, cute animals. Enter Youngwoong, the newest member to be introduced. But with his large hands and piercing eyes, the other members can tell he's different. Could he be… a carnivore?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
